Polkadot TPS ``500--1K+ (parachains)'' & \textbf{27 TPS sustained per parachain; 283 TPS theoretical} & Literature conflates aggregate network capacity (100 parachains $\times$ 27 $\approx$ 2,700 TPS) with single-parachain throughput \\
