ink! for ``secure, cost-effective execution'' & \textbf{FRAME pallet} as primary logic; ink! as API layer & Architecture pivoted for performance; ink! still used via pallet-revive precompile \\
Bridge latency ``5--10s'' & \textbf{Snowbridge E2E: \textasciitilde{}1 minute} after beacon finalization & Full cryptographic proof verification adds latency vs simple bridge estimates \\
